 antioxidant properties. This hypothesis provides a potential angle for preventing or slowing disease progression, emphasizing the importance of diet in personal health." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.ai.edge.gallery" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,522][1044,1098]" drawing-order="10" hint="" /><node index="11" text="Cofee is generally considered safe when taken appropriately, though individual benefits may vary. Its antioxidant-rich properties may help maintain healthy blood vessels and reduce the risk of cardiovascular disorders. It is often recommended alongside other nutrient-rich diets to support overall well-being." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.ai.edge.gallery" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1122][1044,1698]" drawing-order="11" hint="" /></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.google.ai.edge.gallery" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,273][1044,1698]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="37.8 s" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.ai.edge.gallery" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1752][135,1800]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.google.ai.edge.g